; MyMenuButton omits `flat`, so it renders at MenuButton's constructor default (true), not
; Button's (false): one key, two class defaults. DisabledMenuButton sets disabled = true, which
; selects MenuButton's font_disabled_color (Color(1, 1, 1, 0.3)), not Button's
; control_font_disabled_color. Collapsing the two is invisible on MyMenuButton alone.

